<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <p xml:id="Aink153-kilavi">
        tōḻi vāyilvēṇṭi neruṅkiyavaḻi vāyiṉmaṟukkun talaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
         Spoken by the heroine who refused entry, [her] confidante having wanted entry [for the hero], [he] having come closer.
  </p>
</div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink154">
<l>veḷḷāṅ kurukiṉ piḷḷai cetteṉak</l>
<l>kāṇiya ceṉṟa maṭanaṭai nārai</l>
<l>kāṉaṟ cēkkun tuṟaivaṉō</l>
<l>ṭiyāṉevaṉ ceykō poykkumiv vūrē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
       <l> What will I do with the man from the ghat with the seashore grove</l>
       <l>In which the wader with an inexperienced walk</l>
       <l>That went to see, since the hatchling of the white wader died,</l>
        <l>[Now] rests? This town lies!  </l>    </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
